Example: Resilience4j ThreadPoolBulkhead (Java)

```java
import io.github.resilience4j.bulkhead.threadpool.ThreadPoolBulkhead;
import io.github.resilience4j.bulkhead.threadpool.ThreadPoolBulkheadConfig;

ThreadPoolBulkheadConfig cfg = ThreadPoolBulkheadConfig.custom()
  .coreThreadPoolSize(10)
  .maxThreadPoolSize(10)
  .queueCapacity(50)
  .build();

ThreadPoolBulkhead ordersBulkhead = ThreadPoolBulkhead.of("orders", cfg);

Supplier<CompletionStage<String>> decorated = ThreadPoolBulkhead
  .decorateCompletionStage(ordersBulkhead, () -> CompletableFuture.supplyAsync(() -> callExternalService()));

decorated.get().whenComplete((res, ex) -> { /* handle result or fast-fail */ });
```
